===Etymology===
{{ko-etym-native|dot=,}} from {{inh|ko|okm|-}} {{okm-l|ᄒᆞ다〮|hò-tá}}, from {{inh|ko|oko|爲|tr=*HO(Y)-}}. Cognate with {{cog|jje|ᄒᆞ다}}.

It is believed that at an ancient stage, the stem of {{okm-l|ᄒᆞ다〮|hò-tá}} was actually {{lang|okm|*ᄒᆡ-}} ([[w:Yale romanization of Korean|Yale]]: *hoy-), as still evidenced by the irregular infinitive form {{m|ko||하여}} ({{ko-ref|Vovin 2010, p. 27}}).

