#: {{uxa|ko|[[대화]][[-가]] [[산]][[-으로]] '''간다'''.|t=The conversation is going nowhere.|lit=The conversation '''is going''' to the mountains.}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[그들]][[-은]] [[개관식]][[-에]] [[참석하다|참석하러]] ^[[베이징]][[-으로]] '''갔다'''.|t=They '''went''' to Beijing for the opening.|q=formal|audio=그들은 개관식에 참석하러 베이징으로 갔다.ogg}}
# {{lb|ko|auxiliary|with {{m|ko|-어|tr=-}}}} {{n-g|Marks a [[continuous]] action that either stretches from the present into the future, or involves physical movement away from the speaker.}}
#: {{ant|ko|오다|pos=continuous action from the past or towards the speaker}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[다]] [[먹다|먹어]]'''간다'''.|t=I've almost finished my food.}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[땅거미]][[-가]] [[찾다|찾아]][[오다|오고]] [[석양]][[-은]] [[또]] [[저물다|저물어]] '''간다'''.|t=Dusk has found its way, and the evening sun is setting again ['''and will continue to do so'''].}}
# {{lb|ko|of cracks and wrinkles}} to [[appear]]
#: {{uxa|ko|[[금]][[-이]] '''간''' [[유리]]|t=glass that has cracked}}
# {{lb|ko|of time}} to [[pass]]
#: {{syn|ko|흐르다|지나다}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[올해]][[-도]] [[또]] [[다]] '''갔다'''.|t=This year has all but '''passed away''', too.}}
# {{lb|ko|specifically|_|transitive}} to [[last]]
#: {{uxa|ko|[[사흘]][[-도]] [[못]] '''간''' [[결심]]|t=a determination that did not '''last''' even three days}}
# {{lb|ko|colloquial}} to be [[knock out|knocked out]] (e.g. by a [[blow]], by [[alcohol]], etc.)
# {{lb|ko|vulgar}} to [[orgasm]]
# {{n-g|Used as the verbal element for nouns related to understanding or interest.}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[짐작]][[-이]] '''가'''.|t=I can conjecture.}}
#: {{uxa|ko|[[관심]][[-이]] '''가'''.|t=I'm interested in it.}}
