=====Usage notes=====
When used with the particle {{m|ko|-을|pos=accusative marker}}, it means that the speaker is personally considering the situation as factual. When used with the particle {{m|ko|-로|t=by, with|pos=instrumental marker}}, it means that the original perceiver considered the situation as factual, and that the speaker may or may not agree with them. Compare:
* {{ux|ko|[[잘못되다|잘못된]] '''줄'''[[-을]] [[알다]]|t=to know that it is wrong to do}}
* {{ux|ko|[[잘못되다|잘못된]] '''줄'''[[-로]] [[알다]]|t=to think that it is wrong to do}}
When the particle is omitted (as is very common), the meaning can be ambiguous.

