#* {{quote-book|ko|title=ko:채식주의자|trans-title={{w|The Vegetarian}}|author=w:Han Kang|year=2007|year_published=2016|edition=22nd|page=155|isbn=978-89-364-3359-8|publisher=Changbi|location={{w|Paju}}, Republic of Korea|text=[[마침내]] [[새벽]][[-이]] [[되다|되어]] '''아이'''[[-의]] [[이마]][[-를]] [[만지다|만져]][[보다|-보았을]] [[때]] [[그녀]][[-는]] [[손바닥]][[-에]] [[느껴지다|느껴지는]] [[서늘하다|서늘함]][[-에]] [[안도하다|안도했고]], [[안방]][[-을]] [[나가다|나가]] [[거실]] [[베란다]][[-로]] [[들다|드는]] [[푸르스름하다|푸르스름한]] [[박명]][[-을]] [[물끄러미]] [[바라보다|바라보았다]].|t=When it was finally dawn and she touched the '''child''''s forehead, she was relieved at the coolness she felt on her palm. She left the inside room and stared vacantly at the bluish [[twilight]] that penetrated the living room veranda.}}
