Consider also {{cog|ko-pyo|궝이|t=crab}} and {{cog|jje|깅이|t=crab}}, although both could be secondary developments because Koreanic varieties sometimes insert {{IPAfont|/ŋ/}} to break [[hiatus]] between [[vowel]]s. Compare {{m|ko|탱알}}.

Possibly related to {{cog|okm|벌에〮|tr=pèlGéy||t=bug, insect (any small arthropod such as insects, spiders, etc.)}} and {{cog|okm|벌어지〮|tr=pèlGècí|t=idem}}; compare {{cog|ja|細蟹|tr=sasagani|t=spider}}, from compound of {{com|ja|細|tr1=sasa|t1=small|蟹|tr2=kani|t2=crab}}.

