#: {{uxa|ko|서둘러 주시면 '''고맙겠소이다'''. |t=I'd appreciate it if you'd hurry up about it. }}

====Conjugation====
{{m|ko|고맙다}} is in the class of irregularly-inflected words whose stems end in {{m|ko|ㅂ}}. In such words with two syllables or more, vowel harmony in inflections was once followed in both standardized forms of Korean. With the 1988 {{m|ko|[[한글]] [[맞춤법]]|t=Hangeul Orthography}}, the South Korean standard now ignores the vowel harmony, while it is kept in the North.

