# {{lb|ko|in statements}} a [[certain]], [[some]]; [[some]] kind of
#: {{ux|ko|'''무슨''' [[일#work|일]][[-이]] [[있다|있]][[-어서]] [[못]] [[오다|왔어]]. |He couldn't come because he had '''some sort of''' work [to do].}}
