#: {{syn|ko|무덤|묘(墓)}}
# {{lb|ko|archaic|original meaning}} [[mountain]]
#: {{syn|ko|산(山)}}

====Usage notes====
* In the South Korean theoretical standard, the archaic "mountain" sense is covered by the phonetic variant {{m|ko|메}}, and {{m-self|ko|뫼}} should refer solely to the grave. In practice, {{m|ko|메|t=mountain}} is wholly obsolete, while {{m-self|ko|뫼}} still sees occasional use in the "mountain" sense.

