===Etymology 1===
{{ko-etym-native|ws|-다가〮|-tàká|dot=,}} from {{okm-l|다ᄀᆞ다|tako-ta|3=to hold, to have}} + {{okm-l|-아〮|-á|5=verbal infinitive suffix}}. Equivalent to modern {{suffix|ko|[[다그다|다그-]]|-아|pos2=infinitive suffix|id2=infinitive}}.<ref name="Jeon">{{cite-journal|author={{lang|ko|전후민}} (Jeon Hu-min)|title={{lang|ko|{다가}의 변천사}}|trans-title=The history of ''taka''|journal=Urimalgeul|year=2014|volume=63|pages=29—68}}</ref>

====Particle====
{{ko-pos|particle}}

# {{n-g|An emphatic particle.}}
#: {{uxi|ko|[[여기]]'''-다가''' [[두다|두면]] [[되다|되겠]][[-소]]?|Shall it be all right if I put it ''here''?}}
