# [[saying]]... and [[saying]]...; {{n-g|conveys a dispute between opposing viewpoints.}}
#: {{ux|ko|[[돈]][[-을]] [[쓰다|쓰]]'''-느니''' [[아끼다|아끼]]'''-느니''' [[갑론을박]][[-이]] [[계속되다|계속된다]].|t=The dispute continues, with some arguing to spend the money, some to save it.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Colloquially, {{m|ko|-니|-니... -니}} is used instead.
