=====Usage notes=====
* {{m-self|ko|-느니}} causes stem-final {{m|ko|ㄹ}} to drop out.
* {{m-self|ko|-느니}} is used for all verbs, for the existential adjectives {{m|ko|있다}}, {{m|ko|없다}}, and {{m|ko|계시다}}, and for adjectives with tense marking with {{m|ko|-었-}} and {{m|ko|-겠-}}.
* {{m|ko|-으니}} is used for adjectives without tense marking.

=====Alternative forms=====
