===Etymology===
{{ko-etym-native|ws|-ᄃᆞᆶ〮|-tólh}} Beyond Korean, possibly related to {{cog|ja|-}} {{ja-r|達|たち|pos=pluralizing morpheme}}; if so, the ancestral form may have been {{IPAfont|*/tatVk/}} or similar.<ref>{{R:jpx:Vovin 2010|page=120}}</ref>

