# {{n-g|An auxiliary [[plural]] particle with an emphasis on the individuality of each item. See Usage notes for more.}}
#: {{uxi|ko|[[사람]]'''들'''|people, persons}}
#: {{uxi|ko|[[기억]]'''들'''|memories}}
